    Charged formulas (ProForma, section 11.1) localize a charge on a modification,
    e.g. ``PEPT[Formula:Zn:z+2]IDE``. These charges are not part of the charge state
    written after the sequence, but they do contribute to the charge of the
    peptidoform ion (ProForma, section 11.5).

    Returns
    -------
    int
    '''
    def tag_charge(tag) -> int:
        return getattr(tag, 'charge', None) or 0

    charge = 0
